Senior Software Engineer,		(818)306-6193 (do NOT use v-mail yet!)
CCCP, X and Object Guru.		office: 525/C165
Jet Propulsion Lab, M/S 525-3660 4800 Oak Grove Drive, Pasadena, CA 91109
